    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Tipperary Town are honoured to present for sale this superb 5-bedroom Dormer bungalow set on approximately 0.44 acre site, enjoying elevated panoramic views over the idyllic surrounding Golden Vale countryside.\nThis impressive property namely 'Mountain View' extends to approximately 171 sq. m. (1,841 sq. ft.) and occupies a generous 0.44-acre site in the peaceful countryside setting of Bunavie, Pallasgreen, Co. Limerick.\nThe property offers spacious and versatile accommodation with five bedrooms, making it ideally suited to family living. Its elevated position provides stunning panoramic views of the impressive hinterland, while the front mature garden and landscaped grounds create a private and tranquil environment.\nThe generous site offers excellent outdoor space, with attractive lawns, mature planting and vehicular parking. The peaceful rural setting provides the perfect balance of countryside living while remaining within convenient reach of local amenities and surrounding towns.\nThe conveniently located property provides easy access to everyday amenities including a primary school, local shop, church, and community facilities. The property is also within convenient reach of larger centres such as Limerick City, Tipperary Town , Hospital, Kilmallock, and Charleville, all of which offer a broader range of retail, educational, and healthcare services. The location is well connected by regional road networks, making it suitable for commuters travelling within East and South Limerick and into neighbouring counties. Short Commute to Limerick Junction Train Station. This accessibility, combined with the tranquillity of the surrounding countryside, makes the area attractive to purchasers seeking space, privacy, and a quieter lifestyle while remaining connected to employment and amenities in a popular rural location.\nAccommodation consists on Ground Floor: Front Conservatory, Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, Utility Room, Shower Room , DS Bedroom 1, DS Bedroom 2, Attached Garage\nFirst Floor: Landing, Family Bathroom, Bedroom 3, Bedroom 4, Bedroom 5\n\nViewing highly recommended but strictly through Auctioneer Paul Cranley\n\nFeatures\nApprox. 171 sq. m. / 1,841 sq. ft - 5-bedroom Dormer Bungalow Peaceful and private rural setting\nConcrete Drive to front of house\nAttached Garage\nApprox. 0.44-acre site\nC-rated BER"
      },
